{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再拿没想清楚拖住自己，先接下眼前能做的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"先接下眼前\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，却还是愿意尽力，真做起来觉得痛快，也有了些力气和骄傲，不再只问值不值得。\",\n      \"key\": \"觉得痛快\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记着那些舍不得的东西，却再不能像从前那样自然地拥有它们，也说不清该怎么靠近。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得的东西\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心就这样垮下去，急着一遍遍告诉自己撑得住，可牵挂还在，心里始终没法踏实。\",\n      \"key\": \"一遍遍告诉自己\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\", \"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他从非得想透才肯行动的难堪，转向先承担自己能做的一份，改成具体动作，不把它写成一句行动原则。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\", \"R8\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留心里没底却愿意尽力、行动带来的真实痛快和力量，以及一点骄傲。R7重复解释主体性，合并进具体行动；删去心里的不满终于有了去处，因为珠子支持行动带来的快乐，却没有显示不满因此得到安顿。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留牵挂没有消失，写清他仍惦记着珍惜的东西，却不能再像从前那样自然拥有，解释旧歌般的遥远和模糊。不把珠子的旧歌与记忆画面写成他真的想起了一段往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R9\", \"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\", \"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并取舍\",\n      \"why\": \"把愿意继续尽力收进S02-2，把不甘心垮下去、反复自我说服和牵挂仍在放进S02-4，让行动的快乐与内心的焦灼同时成立，不拆成失落、压回去、最后泄气的连续链条。删去贪恋畅快和不再审视软弱，因为前者把真实的痛快夸大成享受，后者与B4反复说服自己的听感相反。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0c998805-2c40-49e1-bf60-6661b6452fce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T163440150073Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1041.157, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T16:52:01.307449+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64403c41d1cdd7ccaf33a862ebdb8c537fd8ab4f0fb2f2ff9438cae4c1b23a0c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T163440150073Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"